{"ref":"BDB, בּוּר","hw":"בּוּר","html":"† <big><big><span dir=\"rtl\">בּוּר</span></big></big>  <strong>vb. </strong><br><strong>Qal</strong>  Inf. cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">לָבוּר</span> <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 9:1\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.9.1\">Ec 9:1</a> (c. acc.); prob. (si vera l.) <strong>make clear, clear up, explain</strong> (VB; so sometimes, in NH <span dir=\"rtl\">ברר</span> q.v.) but read perhaps <span dir=\"rtl\">וְלִבִּי רָאָה</span> 𝔊 𝔖 Bi; or <span dir=\"rtl\">לָתוּר</span> Gr, cf. <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 1:13\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.1.13\">1:13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 2:3\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.2.3\">2:3</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 7:25\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.7.25\">7:25</a>.","next":"BDB, בּוֹשׁ","prev":"BDB, בּוֹר³"}